# Ignore all the files
*
#
# Machine-local / generated (under this repo as `user-emacs-directory'):
#   custom.el, elpa/, rime/, var/, .local/, tree-sitter/, transient/, auto-save-list/
# are NOT whitelisted below → stay untracked by default.
# Managed source lives under !lisp/ etc.; org-html-themes download dir stays ignored
# at the bottom.

# Excludes - only control these files
!.gitignore
!README*.md
!init.el
!early-init.el
!lisp/
!lisp/**
!lisp/**/**

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
lisp/writing/org/org-html-themes
